; AWP table — Counter-Strike 1.6 reference values (SCOPED; unscoped adds spread).
; Scalars: https://csjs.live/weapons/awp (115 dmg, 97.5% armor, 41 RPM /
; 1.45 s cycle, 99% per 500 u, 3 penetration stages, 10+30 ammo,
; 210 u/s, 150 u/s scoped).
; Code constants: https://github.com/s1lentq/ReGameDLL_CS
; - regamedll/dlls/weapons.h: AWP_DAMAGE 115, AWP_RANGE_MODIFER 0.99,
;   AWP_MAX_SPEED 210, AWP_MAX_SPEED_ZOOM 150.
; - regamedll/dlls/wpn_shared/wpn_awp.cpp PrimaryAttack: air 0.85,
;   move fast(>140u/s) 0.25, move slow(>10u/s) 0.1, duck 0.0, stand 0.001;
;   cycle 1.45 s; FireBullets3 penetration 3, BULLET_PLAYER_338MAG.
;   Spread fields below are scoped, atan(spread) to degrees: stand 0.0573,
;   duck 0.0, move 14.0362 (run > 140 branch), air 40.3645. Unscoped shots
;   add +0.08 spread (not encoded; scope state is gameplay-level).
; - regamedll/dlls/weapontype.h: AWP_MAX_CLIP 10, MAX_AMMO_338MAGNUM 30.
; - regamedll/dlls/player.cpp TraceAttack: HITGROUP_HEAD damage x4;
;   TakeDamage: ARMOR_RATIO 0.5 x 1.95 (WEAPON_AWP) = 0.975.
; - regamedll/dlls/cbase.cpp FireBullets3: falloff pow(rangeMod, dist/500);
;   wall damage x0.6 (CHAR_TEX_WOOD), penetration skip 45 u/stage
;   (BULLET_PLAYER_338MAG).
; RecoilTable: bolt-action has no learned spray; 10 cumulative entries encode
; a near-vertical kick (~1.1 deg/shot, tiny alternating yaw) matching the
; punchangle.x -= 2 kick feel, scaled to the table convention. CONSENSUS.
; MaxWallThicknessU 96: consensus (deepest wallbang, still stops at ~120 u).
[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="WeaponData" load_steps=2 format=3]

